gonna probably be running away

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.462
from that experience
to a more familiar one

00:03:36.462 --> 00:03:38.850
which is me so I think it's going

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.170
to push us closer together.

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.400
- Garrett will be the one person

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.820
