- We did like hang out
a little bit last night,

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.840
which I think was that one on one time

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.880
that we both enjoy so it was great

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.020
that we could fit that in as well as

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.150
like participate in a
larger community together.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.920
- I had so many cool experiences here.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.190
I got to join a construction crew

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.070
for a day, I got to
talk about architecture

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.730
with a lot of people
that are conversations

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:01.760
that I don't usually get to have.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.940
- [Niki] Arcosanti is kindof
like a futuristic city

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.332
in the fact that like,
people that come through here

00:11:07.332 --> 00:11:10.290
will be thinking about how
they live in the future

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.740
because of what they do here.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.350
I think both Garrett and I had no idea

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:14.400
what we were getting ourselves into

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.110
when we came here but I'm walking away

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.988
with a lot that I'm thinking
about after being here.

00:11:18.988 --> 00:11:21.372
- Okay bye Arcosanti.

00:11:21.372 --> 00:11:23.289
- [Niki] Bye Arcosanti.

00:11:25.998 --> 00:11:26.831
- Let's go.

00:11:26.831 --> 00:11:28.060
- I would love to steal a
bell, I won't steal a bell,

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.190
I'll buy a bell, is there
a place we can buy a bell,

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.300
those bells are cool, they're everywhere.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.621
You can hear them right now.

00:11:33.621 --> 00:11:34.454
(light music)

00:11:34.454 --> 00:11:36.170
Next week
- [Garrett] On Home Buddies.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.253
(shouts)

00:11:40.349 --> 00:11:42.550
- Ranches sound like hard work.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:43.810
- [Niki] We cooked dinner in the dark.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.050
- [Garrett] This feels
like the late 1800's.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.050
- [Niki] I'm half covered in poop,

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:48.250
I feel like my body's falling apart.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.860
- [Garrett] It's so hard to live out here.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.429
Get out of here, leave me alone.

00:11:51.429 --> 00:11:53.929
(light music)

